{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:InformationTheory.OneDimQouChannel","@type":"LeanModule","name":"InformationTheory.OneDimQouChannel","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.OneDimChannel.parallel_vacuum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.OneDimChannel.parallel_vacuum","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/one-dim-qou-channel.lean#L63-L65","doc":"The vacuum channel is a right identity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.OneDimChannel.vacuum_parallel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.OneDimChannel.vacuum_parallel","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/one-dim-qou-channel.lean#L59-L61","doc":"The vacuum channel is a left identity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.OneDimChannel.parallel_assoc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.OneDimChannel.parallel_assoc","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/one-dim-qou-channel.lean#L54-L57","doc":"Parallel placement is associative. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.OneDimChannel.parallel_comm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.OneDimChannel.parallel_comm","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/one-dim-qou-channel.lean#L50-L52","doc":"Parallel placement is commutative. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.OneDimChannel.parallel_noninteraction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.OneDimChannel.parallel_noninteraction","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/one-dim-qou-channel.lean#L45-L48","doc":"**Non-interaction.** The transmitted invariant of two parallel fibres\nfactorises: `tr_M(A ∥ B) = tr_M(A) · tr_M(B)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.OneDimChannel.parallel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.OneDimChannel.parallel","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/one-dim-qou-channel.lean#L40-L43","doc":"**Parallel placement** of two cladded channels. The surface boundary\nmakes the configuration a split link, over which the Markov trace\nmultiplies, so the joint trace is the product. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.OneDimChannel.vacuum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.OneDimChannel.vacuum","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/one-dim-qou-channel.lean#L37-L38","doc":"The **vacuum channel** (empty fibre): trivial braid, trace `1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.OneDimChannel.trace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.OneDimChannel.trace","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/one-dim-qou-channel.lean#L31-L31","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.OneDimChannel.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.OneDimChannel.mk","kind":"ctor","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/one-dim-qou-channel.lean#L30-L30","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.OneDimChannel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.OneDimChannel","kind":"structure","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/one-dim-qou-channel.lean#L28-L31","doc":"A **one-dimensional QOU channel** over a coefficient ring `R`: the\ncarried information is summarised by its Markov-trace value `trace`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:one-dim-qou-channel","label":"def:one-dim-qou-channel","md":"quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/one-dim-qou-channel.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}